==Strategy==
Being a remake of [[Learned to Love]], this stage plays much the same way: Rush Codename "Red Riding" before she gets to destroy your base. However, the typical [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] chain used to kill the [[H. Nah]]s is significantly more difficult to pull off, thanks to the increased strength magnifications. Attack UP [[Cat Combo|Combos]], secondary attackers, and/or higher levels may be needed to properly knockback the H. Nahs.

Other than that, the added [[Aku Doge]]s serve as little more than road bumps on your way to "Red Riding", [[Le'noir]], and [[Sunfish Jones]]. They can, however, make the Bahamut chain more difficult. Units like [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jellycat]] or [[Ancient Egg: N004 (Special Cat)|Supercar Cat]] can be used to quickly dispose of them, as well as deal additional damage to the H. Nahs, or "Red Riding" herself.

